Yeah. So there's a, the first page after the table of contents is the story.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:58.780
So we have to take them at their word here and believe that this is part of the intended lore, even though it's more or less flavor copy and doesn't, you know, doesn't really say that this is the mechanics behind the game.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:02.680
