00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.400
Yeah, this isn't the lore.

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.300
This is, this is not lore, Mike.

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.780
No, but they're saying this is the story.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:34.360
Like the reason that you, the player or the person you're controlling, making the moves inside the game is playing this game at all is because you have beaten every other video game you own.

