Yeah, yeah. Like, why don't you try something else, okay?

00:06:56.940 --> 00:07:00.460
I don't know. You've shot your last terrorist sounds like a threat from Al Qaeda.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.340
You know, you just get like something in the mail.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.280
You've shot your last terrorist, buddy.

